  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed change of use in the absence of robust market assessment would result in the loss of a community facility. The proposal is therefore contrary to policy DMD17 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014).",
    "The proposed development, in the absence of an adequate sustainable drainage strategy, fails to demonstrate how proposed measures manage the risk of flooding and utilise Sustainable Urban Drainage Systems (SuDS) following the drainage hierarchy in the London Plan, contrary to Section 14 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies SI 13 of the London Plan (2021), CP28 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), DMD61 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014).",
    "The proposed development, by virtue of the loss of the car stacker would contribute unacceptably to parking congestion in the surrounding area which would give rise to conditions to the free flow and safety of vehicular traffic and pedestrians, and fail to encourage sustainable modes of transport, contrary to Section 9 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies T2, T3, T4, T6 and T6.1  of the London Plan (2021), CP24 and CP25 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), DMD45 and DMD47 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
  ],
